     Function ddwwaarrff__ggeett__ffddee__iinnffoo__ffoorr__rreegg33() retrieves a register rule from the
     register rule table associated with a given FDE descriptor, given a pro‐
     gram counter address and rule column number.

     Argument _f_d_e should reference a valid DWARF FDE descriptor.

     Arugment _t_a_b_l_e___c_o_l_u_m_n should hold the column number of the register rule
     desired.

     Argument _p_c should hold the program counter address to be used to locate
